<title>BELGIUM: ATHLETICS-EUROPEAN CROSS-COUNTRY RACE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EUROPEAN CROSS-COUNTRY RACE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLEROI, Belgium 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 3rd European Cross Country Championships on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men's 9.65 km</p>
<p>1. Jon Brown (Britain)  32 minutes 37 seconds</p>
<p>2. Paulo Guerra (Portugal)  33:12</p>
<p>3. Mustapha Essaid (France)  33:19</p>
<p>4. Carsten Jorgenen (Denmark)  33:20</p>
<p>5. Eduardo Henriques (Portugal)  33:28</p>
<p>6. Umberto Pusterla (Italy)  33:36</p>
<p>7. Vincent Rousseau (Belgium)  33:42</p>
<p>8. Yann Millon (France)  33:42</p>
<p>9. Victor Almeida (Portugal)  33:43</p>
<p>10. Andrea Arlati (Italy)  33:44</p>
<p>Men's teams</p>
